#: ../update.c:186
msgid "Update standard folders to current language?"
msgstr "Leqqem ikaramen isluganen n tutlayt tamirant?"

#: ../update.c:188
msgid ""
"You have logged in in a new language. You can automatically update the names "
"of some standard folders in your home folder to match this language. The "
"update would change the following folders:"
msgstr ""
"Tkecmeḍ s tutlayt tamaynut. Tzemreḍ ad tleqqmeḍ s wudem awurman ismawen n "
"kra n yikaramen isluganen deg ukaram-inek·inem i wakken ad yemṣada d tutlayt-"
"a. Aleqqem ad d-yeglu s yisenfal i yikaramen-a:"

#: ../update.c:191
msgid "_Keep Old Names"
msgstr "_Eǧǧ ismawen iqburen"

#: ../update.c:192
msgid "_Update Names"
msgstr "_Leqqem ismawen"

#: ../update.c:218
msgid "Current folder name"
msgstr "Isem n ukaram amiran"

#: ../update.c:223
msgid "New folder name"
msgstr "Isem n ukaram amaynut"

#: ../update.c:233
msgid "Note that existing content will not be moved."
msgstr "Ẓer belli agbur i yellan ur yettwakkas ara"

#: ../update.c:240
msgid "_Don't ask me this again"
msgstr "_Ur d-ssutur ara aya tikkelt-nniḍen"

#: ../update.c:257
msgid "There was an error updating the folders"
msgstr "Tella tuccda deg uleqqem n yikaramen"

#: ../user-dirs-update-gtk.desktop.in.h:1
msgid "User folders update"
msgstr "Aleqqem n yikaramen n useqdac"

#: ../user-dirs-update-gtk.desktop.in.h:2
msgid "Update common folders names to match current locale"
msgstr ""
"Leqqem ismawen n yikarramen ucriken i wakken ad mṣadan d yiɣewwaren idiganen "
"imiranen"
